            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="ctui-pane" data-pane="markdown">
            <h3 class="ctui-pane-heading">Raw markdown</h3>
            <textarea class="ctui-markdown" data-markdown spellcheck="false">Acai is a slender palm native to the floodplains of the Amazon basin. Its deep purple fruit grows in dense clusters and has long been a staple food in the region.

## Growing conditions

Acai prefers warm, humid conditions and consistently moist, fertile soil.

- Protect young palms from frost
- Water deeply during dry spells
- Feed with rich organic matter</textarea>
          </section>

          <section class="ctui-pane" data-pane="preview">
            <h3 class="ctui-pane-heading">Live Preview</h3>
            <div class="ctui-preview-wrap">
